('Swift Spectral Rylak', '|cFFFFD200Legacy|r', 'Even the dead need a lift every now and then.', 776, 242, 64, 5, 194046, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 56647),
('Kah, Legend of the Deep', '|cFFFFD200Achievement: |rThe Derby Dash|n|cFFFFD200Category: |rFishing', '', 2188, 436, 64, 11, 448850, 0, 0, 742, 0, 0, 56647),
('Forged Gladiator\'s Fel Bat', '|cFFFFD200Achievement:|r Gladiator: The War Within Season 1|n|cFFFFD200Category:|r Player vs. Player', 'Awakened from caves in the battlefield, and armored to the fray.', 2218, 424, 64, 2, 449466, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 56647),
('Machine Defense Unit 1-11', '|cFFFFD200Treasure: |rAwakened Cache|n|cFFFFD200Zone: |rThe Ringing Deeps', 'One of many such mechsuits designed to guard the Machine. After years of faithful service it is no longer suited for combat. It does make for an impressive conveyance, though.', 2159, 424, 0, 5, 448188, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 56647),
('Crimson Mudnose', '|cFFFFD200Vendor: |rWaxmonger Squick|n|cFFFFD200Zone: |rThe Ringing Deeps|n|cFFFFD200Cost: |r8125|Hcurrency:2815|h|TInterface\\ICONS\\SPELL_AZERITE_ESSENCE14.BLP:0|t|h', 'Frequently used by kobolds as mounts, the Assembly of the Deeps has decided to allow you access to one of their most loyal mudnoses.', 2209, 230, 0, 2, 449269, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 56647);
