(58156, '11.0.0 [QAD] Documentation IGC', '--[[ \n\n\t--= WORLDPORT =--\n\t\tworldport 2657, -3710.13, 627.082, -970.202, 195.80\n\n\t--= CONSOLE CHEAT =--\n\t\t\n\t\tCreateClientScene 4274\n\n\n\t--= TO VIEW IN GAME =--\nMake a new max level character\n-  openraid\n-  expire\n-  11Raid_Queen\n-  sendevent 90157 (gets her to come down)\n-  sendevent 90158 (gets her to come down all the way)\n-  EFR (makes her respawn quickly)\n-  setworldstate 25964 1 (disables abilities)\n-  setworldstate 26050 1 (makes her go upstairs upon respawn)\n-  engage her once she becomes attackable, then reset her; she\'ll spawn upstairs\n-  worldport 2657, -3710.13, 627.082, -970.202, 195.80\n-  target the boss\n-  sendgeneraltrigger 96 (makes her killable)\n-  engage the boss\n-  death touch the boss (cast 5)\n-  she will die, and then the cinematic will play\n\n\n\t--= CONTACT =--\n\t\t- Quest Designer: \t\tStephen Cavallaro\n\t\t- T2 Producer: \t\t\t\n\t\t- Cinematic Designer: \tWilliam Kime-Hunt\n\n--]] ', 56647),
